# Plasma's "a disc was inserted" pop-up for music CDs: "Play disc in Hearth Player" (docs/PLAYER-DISCS.md).
[Desktop Entry]
X-KDE-Solid-Predicate=[ IS OpticalDisc AND OpticalDisc.availableContent & 'Audio' ]
Type=Service
Actions=hearth-player-play;
X-KDE-Priority=TopLevel

[Desktop Action hearth-player-play]
Name=Play disc in Hearth Player
Icon=hearth-player
Exec=hearth-player --disc %d
